From: SM-G955N Ubuntu port contributors
Subject: [PROPOSAL] DPP owned metadata and DECON power serialization

Fix real deferred caller-lifetime and blank/pan races. No claim that these
explain the previously captured RCU corruption until target qualification.
Original upstream GPL notices retained.

